  "description": "It’s Juliet Monad’s birthday, and she has only one wish—for the coldhearted Duke Lenox Carlyle to break up with her. When the infamously promiscuous duke refuses to let her go, Juliet takes matters into her own hands and leaves under the guise of illusion magic. Haunted by memories of a past life, Juliet is desperate for a way to escape a tragic fate. But the nature of magic isn’t always benevolent, and time isn’t on her side. Does Juliet have no choice but to rely on Duke Carlyle?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
